  "body": "Fixes https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4082\n\n<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium: patch available https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=970249#c9\n   * Mozilla: already fixed https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1539469\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/20148\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/20172 (tentative test for https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5099)\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/20306 (tentative test for https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5065)\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: \n     - [`<input>` should not honor overflow:scroll/auto](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=952651)\n     - [UA stylesheet should include table { text-indent: initial } to conform with HTML standard](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=999088)\n     - [display:inline for `<input type=image>` when it's not rendering an image (ALT text) should use a true CSS inline box](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=948066)\n     - [Default display value of form controls should be inline-block](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=970249)\n   * Firefox:\n     - [overflow: hidden !important UA style for input type=file is not interoperable with WebKit/Chromium](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1597553)\n     - [UA style of option, optgroup, textarea, td are not per spec](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1597560)\n   * Safari:\n      - [`<input>` should not honor overflow:scroll/auto](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=204328)\n      - [UA stylesheet should include table { text-indent: initial } to conform with HTML standard](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=201297)\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4840/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 16, 2021, 11:11 AM UTC (553a52e)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4840/92a152c...553a52e/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 16, 2021, 11:11 AM UTC (553a52e)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4840/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 16, 2021, 11:11 AM UTC (553a52e)\">/rendering.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4840/92a152c...553a52e/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 16, 2021, 11:11 AM UTC (553a52e)\">diff</a> )",
